        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Your AI custom HTTP headers used to be a single global setting. They still apply to your current model, but adding or editing models here does not carry them over. Re-add the headers you need in each model’s “Custom headers” section."
